#: htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/omr-quota/quota.js
msgid "Set a quota per interface based only on its own traffic, or a global quota combining several interfaces. When a quota is reached, every interface it covers is cut or throttled together for the remainder of the month."
msgstr "为单个接口设置仅基于其自身流量的配额，或设置合并多个接口流量的全局配额。达到配额后，该配额涉及的所有接口将在本月剩余时间内一起被关闭或限速。"

